    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Overnight Coast-to-Coast\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\n198020,\nFastest -\nShortest\nCOAST-TO-COAST\nBETWEEN MOST\nCITIES\nSchedules in effect AuG. 1, 1935",
      "TO ALASKA\nVICTORIA\nORIENT\nSEATTLE\nTACOMA\nPORTLAND\nVANCOUVER\nCANADA\nWENATCHEE\n• SPOKANE\nRainier\nMISSOULA\n•PASCO\n• PENDLETON\nUNITED AIR LINES\nCoast-to-Coast Overnight via the direct Mid-Continent Route\nGREAT FALLS\nHELENA\nMYUPUK.\nCrater Lake\nBUTTE\nWEST\nYELLOWSTONE\nBOISE\nTO HAWAII\nTHE ORIENT\nSAN\nFRANCISCO\nSACRAMENTO\nRENO\nELKO\nYosemite\nGen. Grant\nZion\nSeg\nBOULDER DAM\n(LAS VEGAS)\nGrand Canyon\n© SHERIDAN\nMINNEAPOLIS\nST. PAUL\nThe Dude Ranch HURONC\nGrand OCASPER Country\nSIOUX FALLS\nROCHESTER\nTeton\nSALT\nLAKE\nCHEYENNE\nSIOUX CITY Q\nOMAHA\nDES\nMOINES ONA\n(Estes)\nISLAND\nLINCOLN\nMOLINE\nRocky Mountain\n• Bryce\nDENVER\nCOLORADO\nSPRINGS\nST. JOSEPH\nKANSAS CITY\nST LOUIS\nINCHESTER\nBOSTON\nMILWAUKE!\nBAKERSFI\nSPRINGFIELO\nAS VEGAS\nPONCA CITY\nNASHVILLE\nDETROIT\nTOLEDO\nKRON\nHARRISBURGO\nCOLUMBUS C\nPITTSBURGH\nBALTIMORE\nCHARLESTON\nCINCINNATI\nO LOUISVILLE\nBRISTOLO\nGREENSBORO\nCHARLOTTE\nSPARTANSBURG\nNEWARK\nEW YORK\nPHILADELPHIA\n\"CAMDEN\nNASHINGTON\n•TO EUROPE\nLOS ANGELES.\nTO HAWAII 4\nTHE ORIENT.\nSAN DIEGO\n(EXPOSITION CITY)\nSANTA S\nALBUOUEROUI\n2 PHOENIX\nWICHITA FAL\nTULSA\nOKLAHOMA CITY\nLITTLE ROCK\nTEXARKANA\nMEMPH\nBIRMINGHAN\nBIG SPRING\nMACON C\nJMONTGOMERY\nLHARLESTON\nLAKE CHARLES\nBATON ROUGE\n• To Mexico City 1\nHOUSTO\nGAL ESTO\nST. PETERSBUR\nUNITED AIR LINES\nConnecting Lines Flying\nTwin-Engined BOEING Planes\nOther Air Lines\nONASSAU\nTo Mexico City, Central and South America\nTo Cuba, Central and South America\nWHY UNITED IS THE WORLD'S MOST POPULAR AIR LINE!\nLast year United Air Lines flew twice as many passenger - miles as any other air line in the\nworld! This year United is setting new world's air travel records, carrying more passengers\nmore miles than ever before. Now, more than ever, it's the world's most popular air line.\nWhy is United the choice of more air travellers? Satisfied passengers give these reasons:\n\"I like the comfortable altitudes at which\nUnited flies...\n\"Courteous and kindly attention from all\nemployees...\n\"My flying experience covers five years in\nmany different types of planes, but the de-\npendability of your Boeings impresses me...\n\"I have traveled extensively in Europe, Asia\nand America but never have I encountered\nbetter service than that of United Air Lines...\n\"Your stewardess service makes flying\nmuch more enjoyable and interesting..\n\"I have used United on more than 50 dif-\nferent trips, and your service has been con-\nsistently efficient, dependable and pleasant...\n\"Your pilots and equipment inspire confi-\ndence, your unexcelled experience assures it...\n\"I have been made to feel that the comfort\nand pleasure of the passenger is the one aim\nof the management...\nTHESE EXPRESSIONS OF OUR PATRONS HELP TO EXPLAIN WHY\nOLD-TIMERS USUALLY ADVISE FIRST -TIMERS: \"FLY UNITED\"\n• 2•"
    ],
